  "totalBlocks": 72,
  "translatedBlocks": 67,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37b57952d88f1ea7",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 通过 Enhanced Metrics 深化 Amazon SageMaker AI 的可观测性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2307c09bb49a876f",
      "translationZh": "自托管语音 AI 历来需要在可观测性方面做出取舍。服务可以告诉你某个端点是否正常运行，以及它处理了多少请求。而真正影响容量规划和成本管理的问题，却仍被锁在供应商的容器内部：哪些用量会被计费、你的流量使用了哪些功能，以及推理引擎在每块 GPU 上执行着什么操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a214f205d640fa6",
      "translationZh": "如果你在 SageMaker AI 上运行 Deepgram 的语音转文本（STT）和文本转语音（TTS）模型，音频和转录文本就会保留在你自己的 AWS 账户内。这有助于支持你的数据驻留和合规工作，同时无需放弃用于部署、扩缩容和监控的托管控制平面。你的具体义务取决于自身的控制措施和评估，因此请咨询你的合规团队，并查阅 AWS 责任共担模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86497e99033cbda3",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 正通过以下两项创新，弥补计费、功能使用情况和引擎行为方面的可观测性缺口。这两项创新现已可用于 Deepgram SageMaker AI 部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c8f0c630ac7b8dd",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram Enhanced Metrics：由 Deepgram 容器直接发布到你的 Amazon CloudWatch 账户中的用量和计费指标，无需代理、无需边车容器，也无需额外的 IAM 权限。这些消耗单位数值与 AWS Marketplace 按量计费所依据的数值相同，因此你可以将 AWS 账单与实际流量进行核对，细化到模型和传输方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2267fb95166e0a1",
      "translationZh": "Prometheus 和 OpenTelemetry 支持：直接从 Deepgram 容器抓取的引擎级 Prometheus 指标，以及每块 GPU 的加速器指标和主机指标。这两类指标均通过 SageMaker AI 的详细可观测性功能收集，并可从 CloudWatch、Grafana 或任何兼容 Prometheus 的工具中使用 PromQL 查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bf059d4a9175a03",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将逐一介绍这两项能力：它们如何工作、能让你看到哪些此前无法看到的信息，以及如何开始在 Deepgram SageMaker AI 端点上使用它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "58638a36d904ac27",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI 上的 Deepgram",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c1fc479c378498c",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 的语音模型以模型包的形式在 AWS Marketplace 上提供，并在你的账户中部署为 SageMaker AI 实时端点。使用 SageMaker AI，你的端点会自动具备基础可观测性：CloudWatch 中的调用指标（如 ConcurrentRequestsPerModel 和 FirstChunkLatency）、Amazon CloudWatch Logs 中的容器日志，以及由告警驱动的自动扩缩容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ede449a693f01d54",
      "translationZh": "AWS Marketplace 模型包在网络隔离条件下运行。容器无法建立出站连接，这也是重视安全的客户选择这种部署模式的原因。然而，同样的隔离通常也使供应商层面的遥测变得困难。容器无法将指标推送到外部收集器，你也无法查看容器内部。本文介绍的两项能力都能在这一限制下工作：它们都不需要容器打开网络通路，并且都会将数据存入你自己的 CloudWatch 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdf200f82bad3515",
      "translationZh": "关于术语的一点说明：SageMaker AI 自身有一项名为增强指标的端点功能（MetricsConfig 中的 EnableEnhancedMetrics），它为标准端点指标增加了按实例和按 GPU 划分的利用率维度。SageMaker AI 的这项功能与 Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 不同，但互为补充；后者是由 Deepgram 发布的计费和使用量指标，将在后续章节中介绍。本文介绍的是 Deepgram 的这项能力。有关 SageMaker AI 的这项能力，请参阅 Deepgram 的 SageMaker 可观测性指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "767ea93145e92f16",
      "translationZh": "创新 1：借助 Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 实现计费和使用量透明化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e758d32b8d87856",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 能回答标准端点指标无法回答的两个问题：你究竟在为什么付费，以及你的流量实际上如何使用 Deepgram 的各项功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9cd37774caef644",
      "translationZh": "工作原理：沿日志路径传递的指标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d313106b4f1067f2",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 容器将 CloudWatch 嵌入式指标格式（EMF）记录写入容器的标准输出。SageMaker AI 已经会将容器输出转发到端点的 CloudWatch 日志组，而 CloudWatch Logs 会自动从 EMF 记录中提取指标。EMF 路径为你带来以下好处。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "356c11523deebb2e",
      "translationZh": "无需部署代理、边车或采集器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08025353ab6cae20",
      "translationZh": "除了端点已有的日志记录权限外，无需额外的 IAM 权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3c940fd4d8ce217",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS Marketplace 网络隔离环境下也能正常工作，因为指标通过现有的 SageMaker 到 CloudWatch 日志记录路径传输，而非通过任何出站网络连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d98bb141b39efc61",
      "translationZh": "经典 CloudWatch 指标：它们会出现在 aws cloudwatch list-metrics 中，并可用于 get-metric-statistics、仪表板、告警和指标数学运算，无需在端点配置中启用任何功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6272902e6a70fdb",
      "translationZh": "所有维度均为低基数，且不包含任何个人身份信息（PII）：不包含转录文本、TTS 输入或逐请求标识符。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f858858bf1f65045",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 会跨你的 AWS 账户和区域中的 Deepgram 端点聚合指标。这些维度涵盖类别、模型和传输方式，但不包括端点名称或实例 ID，因此你无法将此指标流筛选为仅包含某个端点或实例的数据。如需按端点、实例或 GPU 查看细分数据，请使用下一节中的 Prometheus 和 OpenTelemetry 指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b3e6b7e267f74ee",
      "translationZh": "核对你的 AWS Marketplace 账单：Deepgram/SageMakerInference 命名空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0ee285670e7e06b",
      "translationZh": "计费命名空间会为每个已完成的请求生成一条记录，涵盖每个流式会话、预录音请求和 TTS 请求。ConsumedUnits 指标包含的可计费单位值，与 AWS Marketplace 按用量计费所依据的值相同。下表列出了此命名空间发布的指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42eaa6d55dd0ffe0",
      "translationZh": "该请求的可计费推理单位数。某一时段内的总和即为计费总量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d218a9de6316813e",
      "translationZh": "处理的音频时长（语音转文本）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ff1d2a417230456",
      "translationZh": "合成的字符数（文本转语音）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1727e182e816cbf",
      "translationZh": "维度按三种粒度发布（[Category]、[Category, Model] 和 [Category, Model, Transport]），因此，你可以在同一命名空间中查询本月流式 STT 的费用，以及其中 nova-3 占了多少。例如，流式语音转文本每小时消耗的单位总数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53d55d7a60e686f0",
      "translationZh": "SampleCount 是已计费请求的数量。由于这些都是常规的 CloudWatch 指标，你可以构建面向财务的计费仪表板，或根据消耗的单位数设置预算告警。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "09965a9a1739ab98",
      "translationZh": "了解你的端点如何被使用：Deepgram/SelfHosted 命名空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb9e1f3c73b76104",
      "translationZh": "第二条数据流由 Deepgram API 服务器自身发出，按方法、模型层级和已启用功能细分原始使用量，与计费无关。它回答产品层面的问题：流式与预录制的流量各有多少，哪些模型层级处理的音频最多，以及你的应用实际上启用了哪些功能（说话人分离、智能格式化、信息遮蔽、关键术语提示）。下表列出了此命名空间中的指标以及每项指标所带的维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b95cc40d22fb20db",
      "translationZh": "流式与预录制的用量对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79deb11ddd027690",
      "translationZh": "按模型层级统计处理的音频量（例如，nova-3、flux）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410c6cebde66c14e",
      "translationZh": "按已启用功能统计使用量（例如，diarize、smart_format、redact）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa9707523e993846",
      "translationZh": "TTS、智能功能和语音代理的使用量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a68a5a9978b6d5b",
      "translationZh": "例如，过去 24 小时内有多少音频是在启用说话人分离功能的情况下处理的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d76b7e8d58c52de0",
      "translationZh": "使用量数据流默认开启，可通过在端点配置中覆盖单个环境变量来禁用（DEEPGRAM_API_01: emf.enabled=false）。计费数据流无法禁用。它是计量流水线的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "508becf89a1c8efd",
      "translationZh": "创新 2：借助 Prometheus 和 OpenTelemetry 实现引擎级和单 GPU 级可观测性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf8efa6d86fc63a1",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 容器提供一个 Prometheus 指标端点，而 SageMaker AI 的详细可观测性功能会在为该端点提供支持的每个实例上运行由 AWS 托管的 OpenTelemetry Collector。该采集器抓取容器的指标并将结果导出至 CloudWatch，同时还会导出每个 GPU 的指标和主机级指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "748d7a14f9fcb36e",
      "translationZh": "启用详细可观测性后，三个指标来源会将指标发布到 CloudWatch 的 OTel 兼容指标存储中。下表介绍了每个来源及其重要性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c86ba0ae9cca553",
      "translationZh": "按 GPU 分列的指标序列。在多 GPU 实例上，每个 GPU 都会单独报告，因此，已达到饱和状态的设备不会被汇总或平均后的利用率数值掩盖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "834ab7abddc5d9b8",
      "translationZh": "每个实例的标准 Prometheus node-exporter 指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79f5c688e54a2fea",
      "translationZh": "采集器直接抓取 Deepgram 容器的 Prometheus 端点。这些指标与 Deepgram 自托管客户用于容量规划的 API 和 Engine 指标相同，现在无需自行运行任何采集器，即可在 SageMaker AI 上获取。完整参考信息请参阅 Deepgram 的 Metrics Guide。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3a2c3a34264715e",
      "translationZh": "engine_estimated_stream_capacity 是 Deepgram 引擎自身对该实例能够持续支持的并发流数量的估计。将其与 engine_active_requests 进行比较，即可获得引擎报告的容量余量信号，为扩缩容决策提供依据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0edd27a50f2dd73f",
      "translationZh": "每个时间序列都带有 SageMaker 资源标签，包括 aws.sagemaker.endpoint.name、变体名称和实例 ID。你可以筛选出单个端点，在横向扩展的实例集群中单独查看某个实例，或比较同一实例内的各个 GPU。由于采集器运行在主机上、模型容器之外，因此在 AWS Marketplace 网络隔离环境下也能正常工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9ae135e2eef2ce9",
      "translationZh": "新创建的端点默认启用详细可观测性，每 60 秒发布一次指标。要显式设置它，例如为该功能推出之前创建的端点启用它，或更改发布频率，请在端点配置中使用 MetricsConfig：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f80067a9b3bfa78",
      "translationZh": "对于已经在处理流量的端点，请创建新的端点配置并运行 update-endpoint。此次更新采用蓝绿部署，端点会保持服务不中断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5dea1f04dab9f51f",
      "translationZh": "从 CloudWatch、Grafana 或任何兼容 Prometheus 的工具中使用 PromQL 查询",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e42ddbe42c2c3012",
      "translationZh": "这些指标存储在 CloudWatch OTel 指标存储中，并通过 PromQL 查询。在 CloudWatch 控制台的 PromQL 编辑器中，将每个 GPU 的利用率指标筛选到某个端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aee8167cc91d92c6",
      "translationZh": "CloudWatch 还为这些指标提供标准的、兼容 Prometheus 的 HTTP API，并使用 SigV4 进行身份验证：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8410e2265fe2097",
      "translationZh": "如果你已统一使用 Grafana 或其他以 Prometheus 为原生基础的可观测性技术栈，就可以将现有工具指向你的 SageMaker AI 实例集群：无需并行维护另一套监控技术栈，也无需导出流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f6c3f65887aa17b",
      "translationZh": "选择合适的指标流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "645642e6e97b0a17",
      "translationZh": "这两项创新是对 SageMaker AI 内置指标的补充，而非替代。下表将常见问题与能够回答这些问题的指标流对应起来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccb706350a8ebd43",
      "translationZh": "端点是否健康？请求是否出错或启动缓慢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d78d92a0a470b970",
      "translationZh": "标准 SageMaker 指标（ConcurrentRequestsPerModel、FirstChunkLatency、Invocation5XXErrors）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "659bcf467d12e4f7",
      "translationZh": "我的 Marketplace 账单会是多少，哪些模型产生了这些费用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a49abfa8f553583c",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 增强指标（Deepgram/SageMakerInference，账户级）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a057a730dd4bce94",
      "translationZh": "我的流量实际使用了哪些功能和模型层级？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "994397bf7edd005c",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram 增强指标（Deepgram/SelfHosted，账户级）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b74f6f074916a51c",
      "translationZh": "每个 GPU 的饱和程度如何？特定端点的每个实例还剩多少流处理容量？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ecfaf72f38497fd",
      "translationZh": "通过详细可观测性接入 Prometheus/OTel（DCGM 和 Deepgram 引擎指标，按端点/实例/GPU 细分）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a76641832fcf23f",
      "translationZh": "Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 无需设置：从 Deepgram SageMaker AI 端点开始处理流量的那一刻起，这些指标就会流入你的 CloudWatch 账户。新端点默认启用详细可观测性；现有端点只需更改一次端点配置即可添加此功能。要开始使用，请参考以下资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cad41d263693f5f",
      "translationZh": "从 AWS Marketplace 部署 Deepgram，并按照《在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署 Deepgram》中的说明操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac417f36e5545dea",
      "translationZh": "参考资料：Deepgram Enhanced Metrics、Prometheus 与 OpenTelemetry 指标，以及《指标指南》，其中列出了完整的 Deepgram API 和引擎指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90cbcd24d1c2a94b",
      "translationZh": "AWS 文档：SageMaker AI 端点的详细可观测性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ccd06507de42b77",
      "translationZh": "自托管语音 AI 不再让服务的请求计数器与供应商的账单之间存在脱节。Deepgram Enhanced Metrics 会将 AWS Marketplace 计费所依据的确切用量单位直接送入你自己的 CloudWatch 账户，无需任何基础设施。这些单位背后的功能级用量也会送入同一账户。借助 SageMaker AI 详细可观测性对 Prometheus 和 OpenTelemetry 的支持，只需在团队已使用的工具中执行一次 PromQL 查询，即可获取 Deepgram 引擎自身的容量和负载指标，以及每个 GPU 的利用率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c20af54973bff97",
      "translationZh": "继用于支持访问的 IAM Temporary Delegation 之后，这些能力是 Deepgram 对 SageMaker AI 的最新投入，将其作为自托管语音 AI 的首选部署方案。这延续了 Deepgram 的承诺：让第二天的运维体验与第一天的部署体验相匹配。目前在 SageMaker AI 上架的 Deepgram 模型，包括 Nova、Flux 和 Aura-2，均提供 14 天试用，无需额外费用。你的团队可以在作出承诺之前，在自己的 AWS 账户中搭建真实的部署环境。在 SageMaker AI 上运行 Deepgram 模型会产生端点托管费用，包括 GPU 实例费用。此外，还会产生 Amazon CloudWatch 日志和指标费用，以及相关网络资源费用。虽然 Deepgram 试用不收取额外费用，但 AWS 基础设施费用从部署开始时即会产生。请查看 SageMaker AI 定价，并使用 AWS Cost Explorer 监控支出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
